'''Energized is''' a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was obtainable in the [[Halloween Event 2025|2025 Halloween Event]] by purchasing the [[2025 Halloween Box]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
The blade of this knife is a dark shade of neon, along with neon green bordering it. The handle is grey and black appearing futuristic, while the guard is fully grey. 
== Trivia ==

* It has a [[Energized (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.
